# Source spreadsheets stay out of the repository.
#
# These hold HPB's own programme inventory and the map's working geometry. They
# were tracked until the history was rewritten to drop them, so this rule is what
# stops `git add -A` putting them back.
#
# hpb-programme-inventory-tagged-C.xlsx is still the input to
# obesity-system-map/tools/import_inventory.py. Keep it beside this file to
# regenerate src/data/intervention/programmes.json; a fresh clone will not have
# it and cannot regenerate until someone supplies it.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
